WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:39.230
In the year 2009, humanity
encountered its first alien race.

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:44.360
The result was an intergalactic war with a militaristic race of giants called Zentraedi.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.210
The Earth was thrown into what
seemed a never-ending crisis.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:51.210
In the year 2010, March,
the war was brought to an end.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.120
In April of that same year,
the New Unity Government was established...

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:58.070
...bringing together mankind and the
Zentraedi into peaceful co-existence.

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:04.270
This resulted in a mass micronization of the remaining Zentraedi via the "Micron Process."

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:10.260
In September of 2011, the Unity Government devised a colonization plan...

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.660
...centered upon the preservation
of the human race.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:16.020
In September of the next year,
the first colonial transport...

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:17.780
...the Megaroad One
began its journey.

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:23.650
In September of 2030, the first of
the new Macross-class transports...

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:27.770
...a gigantic vessel dwarfing its
Megaroad predecessor, departed from Earth.

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:30.540
These ships could carry in
excess of one million people.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:38.910
In 2038, the 37th colonial expedition, the
7th Macross fleet, launched from Earth orbit.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.710
Its destination -- the Galactic Core.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:44.290
It is now 2045...

